WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.940
This house was only flooded once and that was during Katrina, and it took thirty inches of water.

2
00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:13.960
Not only is the land here close to the levee, it's high, but this house is terraced about three and half feet above the street.

3
00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:19.960
That made the water level inside not very high.

4
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.720
The most important thing though was the house was designed to flood.

5
00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.220
The whole ground floor is masonry.

6
00:00:27.220 --> 00:00:28.631
The walls are solid masonry.

7
00:00:28.631 --> 00:00:33.100
There is no wood whatsoever except the trim.

8
00:00:33.100 --> 00:00:40.580
So after Katrina it was a matter of pressure washing the inside walls and sweeping out the water.

9
00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.040
That's basically all we did.

10
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:46.580
We did lose the lower cabinet doors in the kitchen, but that's the only thing that we lost.
